Package: synthpanel
Version: 0.1.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: SynthPanel contributors <maintainers@synthpanel.io>
Architecture: amd64
Description: free, open-source LEMP control panel
 SynthPanel is a lightweight server control panel written in Rust. It
 installs and manages Nginx, multi-version PHP-FPM, MariaDB/PostgreSQL
 and Redis, and exposes a clean web UI, a REST API and a CLI.
